# Influencer's Weekend Drive

A popular content creator shared this image on social media during a luxury weekend outing.
At first glance, it seems like just another car photograph. However, careful observation and open-source intelligence techniques can reveal much more than intended.

Your task is to identify:

The exact car model shown in the image.
The name of the content creator who posted it.
The latitude and longitude co-ordinates (upto 2 decimal places) of the location where the image was taken.

Combine your findings in the following format:

flag{carname + contentcreatorname + lat,long}

Rules:
-> Use lowercase letters.
-> Put no leading spaces between the names, define the flag only in the format provided. 
-> Do not include special characters unless they are part of the actual name.

Example: flag{toyotafortuner + johndoe + 0.00,0,00}

Difficulty: Medium - Hard
Category: OSINT
